&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, you acknowledge that Amplitude processes your personal data in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://amplitude.com/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Amplitude Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Staying Safe - Protect Yourself From Recruitment Fraud&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We are aware of individuals and entities fraudulently representing themselves as Amplitude recruiters and/or hiring managers. Amplitude will never ask for financial information or payment, or for personal information such as bank account number or social security number during the job application or interview process. Any emails from the Amplitude recruiting team will come from an @&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://amplitude.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address. You can learn more about how to protect yourself from these types of fraud by referring to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;this article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;. Please exercise caution and cease communications if something feels suspicious about your interactions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Amplitude is the leading AI analytics platform, helping over 4,700 customers—including Atlassian, Burger King, NBCUniversal, and Square—build better products and digital experiences. With powerful AI Agents embedded across our platform, teams can analyze, test, and optimize user experiences faster than ever. Ranked #1 across multiple categories in G2’s Winter 2026 Report, Amplitude is the best-in-class solution for product, data, and marketing teams. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an organization, we deliver for our customers by living our values. We operate from a place of humility, take ownership of problems and successes, approach challenges with a growth mindset, and put our customers at the center of everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplitude’s Commitment to Diversity Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion (DEI): &lt;/strong&gt;Amplitude believes that diversity enables the creation of better products, improves the ability to solve complex problems, and drives more powerful solutions. We strive to create an environment of inclusion—one focused on psychological safety, empathy, and human connection—that will allow employees of all backgrounds to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’d join a high-performing team of Account Executives and own a mixed book of spending accounts with real expansion potential alongside a host of untapped prospect accounts to hunt and win.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll split your time between working alongside peers in the office and getting in front of customers and partners in the field. We have beautiful office space near Borough Market with a real sense of team spirit and shared goals. This is a role for someone who wants to build something, not just manage it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a mix of customers and prospects who are high growth enterprises (around 2k - 10k employees with a turnover of roughly 250 - 500m).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running full enterprise sales cycles with a value-first mindset — discovery, demos, and exec presentations tailored to what you heard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evangelise and sell all components of our platform but also understand the dynamics of selling a complex platform solution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate customers on their AI product development maturity and journey, providing customer centric support and guidance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building pipeline through outbound, AI-assisted tools, SDR partnership, marketing programmes, and the partner ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving wins with net new logos that will help you grow your territory for next year and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying MEDDPICC with real rigour — qualifying hard, building Champions, getting to Economic Buyers early, and forecasting with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Becoming a product evangelist across Marketing, Product, and Engineering personas — selling technical and commercial value at every level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working the full internal village: SDRs, Solutions Consultants, Partners, Customer Success, Legal — everyone aligned around customer value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise SaaS or AI sales experience, ideally with deals $50k - $300k ARR&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine hunter — consistent pipeline generation and a land-and-expand mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC (or equivalent) applied in how you run deals, not just how you update your CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong C-suite presence — able to uncover business value beyond features and build relationships that last&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally curious and empathetic; someone who experiments with the sales process rather than just running the same play&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to multi-thread and to sell a complex platform solution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, you acknowledge that Amplitude processes your personal data in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://amplitude.com/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Amplitude Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Staying Safe - Protect Yourself From Recruitment Fraud&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We are aware of individuals and entities fraudulently representing themselves as Amplitude recruiters and/or hiring managers. Amplitude will never ask for financial information or payment, or for personal information such as bank account number or social security number during the job application or interview process. Any emails from the Amplitude recruiting team will come from an @&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://amplitude.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address. You can learn more about how to protect yourself from these types of fraud by referring to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;this article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;. Please exercise caution and cease communications if something feels suspicious about your interactions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Amplitude is the leading AI analytics platform, helping over 4,700 customers—including Atlassian, Burger King, NBCUniversal, and Square—build better products and digital experiences. With powerful AI Agents embedded across our platform, teams can analyze, test, and optimize user experiences faster than ever. Ranked #1 across multiple categories in G2’s Winter 2026 Report, Amplitude is the best-in-class solution for product, data, and marketing teams. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an organization, we deliver for our customers by living our values. We operate from a place of humility, take ownership of problems and successes, approach challenges with a growth mindset, and put our customers at the center of everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplitude’s Commitment to Diversity Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion (DEI): &lt;/strong&gt;Amplitude believes that diversity enables the creation of better products, improves the ability to solve complex problems, and drives more powerful solutions. We strive to create an environment of inclusion—one focused on psychological safety, empathy, and human connection—that will allow employees of all backgrounds to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Executive Assistant to support our Head of Marketing at Amplitude. This is a highly visible role that goes beyond traditional executive support—you&#39;ll help protect executive time, turn ideas into action, and ensure important work keeps moving across the marketing organization and broader company. The ideal candidate combines exceptional operational strength and judgment with a high-agency mindset and strong AI fluency, using technology to make our leaders and teams more connected, efficient, and effective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our San Francisco headquarters and follows Amplitude&#39;s hybrid work model. Regular in-office collaboration is an important part of the role, enabling close partnership with the Head of Marketing and cross-functional teams while maintaining flexibility where appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As an Executive Assistant, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect executive time and create leverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively manage complex calendars, travel, meeting preparation, communications, decisions, and follow-ups, ensuring the Head of Marketing can focus on the highest-impact priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn ideas into action:&lt;/strong&gt; Help transform early-stage ideas and rough concepts into clear next steps, briefs, pilots, owners, and timelines. Jumpstart projects by clarifying roles, coordinating stakeholders, establishing tracking, and bringing a first version to life before handing execution off to the appropriate team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep priorities moving:&lt;/strong&gt; Create visibility across key priorities and initiatives, track follow-ups and decisions, surface blockers, and ensure important work doesn&#39;t stall or fall through the cracks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI to improve how we work:&lt;/strong&gt; Run and co-manage AI-powered workflows and systems that improve productivity, team cohesion, communication, and effectiveness. Monitor quality, troubleshoot failures, and continuously improve workflows over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support high-impact marketing initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Help coordinate leadership meetings, offsites, QBRs, team experiences, customer initiatives, and external events—including emerging AI-focused marketing events and programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great addition to the team if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly proactive and bring a &lt;strong&gt;high-agency mindset&lt;/strong&gt; to your work. You don&#39;t wait for perfect instructions and are comfortable taking the first step to move something forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are &lt;strong&gt;operationally strong and process-oriented&lt;/strong&gt;, while understanding that process should simplify work rather than create unnecessary bureaucracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an &lt;strong&gt;AI-fluent practitioner&lt;/strong&gt; who actively uses AI tools to improve your own productivity and the effectiveness of the teams you support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent simplifier who can move seamlessly between small details and ambiguous, cross-functional problems while keeping the bigger picture in view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build trust quickly and communicate effectively with executives, cross-functional partners, and external stakeholders, while exercising exceptional judgment and discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At a minimum, you need to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as an Executive Assistant supporting VP- or C-level executives in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex executive calendars, domestic and international travel, meeting logistics, expenses, and executive communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience coordinating projects, events, or cross-functional initiatives and driving follow-through across multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with Google Workspace and experience using AI tools or automation to improve workflows, productivity, or decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of handling highly confidential information with professionalism, integrity, sound judgment, and discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work from our San Francisco office as part of our hybrid work model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our values:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Amplitude, our values guide how we show up for one another and for our customers:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Humility: &lt;/strong&gt;We operate from a place of empathy and openness, seeking to understand many points of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;We take the initiative to solve problems that drive our shared company success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re tenacious in the face of challenges and seek feedback in order to grow ourselves and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Centricity:&lt;/strong&gt; We put the customer at the center of everything we do and are deeply committed to their success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about the well-being of our team:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer competitive pay and benefits packages that reflect our commitment to the health and well-being of our Ampliteers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of our benefit programs include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent ​Medical, ​Dental and ​Vision insurance coverages, with 100% employer-paid premiums for employee Medical, ​Dental,​ ​​​​​​​​Vision on select plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) retirement plan with an employer match of up to 1% of your eligible pay each pay period up to $2,000 annually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off, ​p​aid holidays, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous stipends to spend on what matters most to you, whether that’s wellness (monthly), commuter transit/parking (monthly), learning and development (quarterly), new hire home office equipment, and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent Parental benefits including​:​ 12 weeks of Paid Parental Leave, Carrot Fertility Benefits/Adoption/Surrogacy support, Back-up Child Care support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellness benefits including no cost employee access to Modern Health coaching &amp;amp; therapy sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Program​ (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other fun facts about Amplitude:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our customers love us! They&#39;ve said we&#39;re the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/categories/product-analytics/enterprise&quot;&gt;#1 product analytics solution&lt;/a&gt; for 23 quarters in a row on G2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care a lot about product innovation. We&#39;ve made significant investments in talent and infrastructure to build the most powerful AI analytics platform on the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We invest in our people. We offer mentorship programs, management training, and wellness initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We give back to our communities. We give every Ampliteer a charitable giving grant and paid volunteer time off.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We were founded in 2012, went public via a direct listing in September 2021, and are now trading under the ticker $AMPL.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a global and fast-growing team! We have employees around the world and offices in San Francisco (HQ), New York, Vancouver, Amsterdam, London, Paris, Singapore, and Tokyo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our mascot is Data Monster, who loves to chow down on numbers, charts, and graphs. Nom nom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Amplitude provides equal employment opportunities (EEO). All applicants are considered without regards to race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, veteran status, or sexual orientation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is eligible for equity, benefits and other forms of compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based on legislation in California, the following details are for individuals who will work for Amplitude in San Francisco Bay Area of California. Salary range: $138,000 - $207,000 total target cash (inclusive of bonus or commission)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, you acknowledge that Amplitude processes your personal data in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://amplitude.com/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Amplitude Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Staying Safe - Protect Yourself From Recruitment Fraud&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We are aware of individuals and entities fraudulently representing themselves as Amplitude recruiters and/or hiring managers. Amplitude will never ask for financial information or payment, or for personal information such as bank account number or social security number during the job application or interview process. Any emails from the Amplitude recruiting team will come from an @&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://amplitude.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address. You can learn more about how to protect yourself from these types of fraud by referring to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;this article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;. Please exercise caution and cease communications if something feels suspicious about your interactions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Amplitude is the leading AI analytics platform, helping over 4,700 customers—including Atlassian, Burger King, NBCUniversal, and Square—build better products and digital experiences. With powerful AI Agents embedded across our platform, teams can analyze, test, and optimize user experiences faster than ever. Ranked #1 across multiple categories in G2’s Winter 2026 Report, Amplitude is the best-in-class solution for product, data, and marketing teams. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an organization, we deliver for our customers by living our values. We operate from a place of humility, take ownership of problems and successes, approach challenges with a growth mindset, and put our customers at the center of everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplitude’s Commitment to Diversity Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion (DEI): &lt;/strong&gt;Amplitude believes that diversity enables the creation of better products, improves the ability to solve complex problems, and drives more powerful solutions. We strive to create an environment of inclusion—one focused on psychological safety, empathy, and human connection—that will allow employees of all backgrounds to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an AI analytics company, Amplitude partners with AI native startups to help them move faster from insight to product market fit and from product market fit to scale. Startups are a critical driver of our ecosystem and growth strategy. Our mission is to create new pathways for founders to discover Amplitude and adopt it early in their growth journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a strategic, ecosystem-driven leader to run and evolve Amplitude’s Global Startup and Venture Program. This person will shape how we engage founders, partner with VCs and incubators, and position Amplitude as the platform of choice for AI native startups worldwide. You will become an indispensable resource for founders navigating product market fit and growth, and a trusted partner across the AI startup ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;As a Global Startup and Venture Program Lead, you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the Startup and Venture Strategy-&lt;/strong&gt; Own and scale the Amplitude for Startups program while building strategic relationships with VCs, accelerators, and ecosystem partners to drive global adoption among AI native startups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Founder Engagement and Ecosystem Presence-&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute a founder-focused engagement strategy, including high-impact events and community initiatives, to position Amplitude as the trusted AI analytics partner for startups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent Amplitude in Key Startup Markets –&lt;/strong&gt; Travel regularly to attend and host events primarily in San Francisco and New York, with select international engagements, to strengthen founder relationships, deepen venture partnerships, and expand Amplitude’s presence within priority ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Activation and Growth-&lt;/strong&gt; Optimize the startup web experience and activation journey, partnering with product and marketing teams to deliver a strong customer experience and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Cross Functional Impact-&lt;/strong&gt; Align startup initiatives with Product, Sales, and Marketing by building scalable program frameworks, defining success metrics, and ensuring insights from founders inform company strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Strategy and Support - &lt;/strong&gt;Build our event model for startups, working with team on topics, presentations and execution. Support on the ground when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Develop the Team -&lt;/strong&gt; Manage and develop a Startup Marketing Specialist and contractor while building processes that enable efficient, scalable execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great addition to the team if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+&amp;nbsp; years of experience in startups, venture capital, ecosystem partnerships, or growth programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established relationships within the Bay Area VC and startup community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of founder needs, product market fit challenges, and early-stage growth dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling strategic programs that drive measurable adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in designing and running high-impact events and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep interest in AI native ecosystems and emerging technology trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to craft compelling narratives for founders and investors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with experience defining program metrics and reporting on business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating cross-functionally and influencing across Product, Sales, and Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder’s mindset with the ability to move quickly, think strategically, and execute thoughtfully&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel ~10-15% of the time to Amplitude, partner, and industry events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who We Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Company: &lt;/strong&gt;Amplitude is filled with humble, life-long learners who are eager to help one another and the company succeed. Our values of growth mindset, ownership, and humility are core to the way we work: we’re tenacious in the face of challenges, we take the initiative to solve problems that drive our shared success, and we operate from a place of empathy and openness, seeking to understand many points of view.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Product: &lt;/strong&gt;Amplitude is a digital analytics platform—we help companies capture data they can trust, uncover clear insights about customer behavior, and take faster action. This empowers teams to build better product experiences that drive business growth. We’re super proud of what we’ve built and continue to expand: a platform that empowers companies to thrive in the digital era.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We care about the well-being of our team:&lt;/strong&gt; We offer competitive pay and benefits packages that reflect our commitment to the health and well-being of our Ampliteers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of our benefit programs include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent ​Medical, ​Dental, and ​Vision insurance coverages, with 100% employer-paid premiums for employee ​Medical, ​Dental,​ ​​​​​​​​Vision on select plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible time off, ​p​aid holidays, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous stipends to spend on what matters most to you, whether that’s wellness (monthly), commuter transit/parking (monthly), learning and development (quarterly), home office equipment (annual), and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent Parental benefits including​:​ 12-20 weeks of Paid Parental Leave, Carrot Fertility Benefits/Adoption/Surrogacy support, Back-up Child Care support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellness benefits including no cost employee access to Modern Health coaching &amp;amp; therapy Sessions and high quality physician office experience via One Medical membership (select U.S. locations only)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Program​ (ESPP)​&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other fun facts about Amplitude:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We were recognized in the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.newsweek.com/rankings/newsweek-excellence-index-2024&quot;&gt;Newsweek Excellence Index 2024&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our customers love us! They&#39;ve said we&#39;re the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.g2.com/categories/product-analytics/enterprise&quot;&gt;#1 product analytics solution&lt;/a&gt; for 19 quarters in a row on G2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care A LOT about product innovation. Fast Company called us the #3 most innovative enterprise company in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We invest in our people. We offer mentorship programs, management training, and wellness initiatives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We give back to our communities. We give every Ampliteer a charitable giving grant and paid volunteer time off.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We were founded in 2012, went public via a direct listing in September 2021, and are now trading under the ticker $AMPL.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re a global and fast-growing team! We have employees around the world and offices in San Francisco (HQ), New York, Vancouver, Amsterdam, London, Paris, Singapore, and Tokyo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our mascot is Data Monster, who loves to chow down on numbers, charts, and graphs. Nom nom.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Amplitude provides equal employment opportunities (EEO). All applicants are considered without regards to race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex, marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, veteran status, or sexual orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based on legislation in California, the following details are for individuals who will work for Amplitude in San Francisco Bay Area of California. Salary range: $167,000 - $251,000 total target cash (inclusive of bonus or commission)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, you acknowledge that Amplitude processes your personal data in accordance with the &lt;a href=&quot;https://amplitude.com/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Amplitude Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Staying Safe - Protect Yourself From Recruitment Fraud&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We are aware of individuals and entities fraudulently representing themselves as Amplitude recruiters and/or hiring managers. Amplitude will never ask for financial information or payment, or for personal information such as bank account number or social security number during the job application or interview process. Any emails from the Amplitude recruiting team will come from an @&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://amplitude.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address. You can learn more about how to protect yourself from these types of fraud by referring to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/consumer-alerts/2023/05/scammers-are-hijacking-job-ads-heres-how-spot-fakes&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;this article&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;. Please exercise caution and cease communications if something feels suspicious about your interactions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Amplitude is the leading AI analytics platform, helping over 4,700 customers—including Atlassian, Burger King, NBCUniversal, and Square—build better products and digital experiences. With powerful AI Agents embedded across our platform, teams can analyze, test, and optimize user experiences faster than ever. Ranked #1 across multiple categories in G2’s Winter 2026 Report, Amplitude is the best-in-class solution for product, data, and marketing teams. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an organization, we deliver for our customers by living our values. We operate from a place of humility, take ownership of problems and successes, approach challenges with a growth mindset, and put our customers at the center of everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplitude’s Commitment to Diversity Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion (DEI): &lt;/strong&gt;Amplitude believes that diversity enables the creation of better products, improves the ability to solve complex problems, and drives more powerful solutions. We strive to create an environment of inclusion—one focused on psychological safety, empathy, and human connection—that will allow employees of all backgrounds to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Amplitude is moving fast, from product analytics to an AI-native platform with agents embedded across the product, used by over 4,700 companies. We are looking for a strong design leader with a builder mindset to lead a 15-person design team through the next phase of growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a player-coach role&lt;/strong&gt;. You manage and grow the team. You also stay in the actual work: elevating quality through feedback, pairing with designers on the hardest UX puzzles, and asking the right questions to unlock the crux of the problem. You&#39;ll know every product surface well enough to raise its quality — even if you don&#39;t own any single one end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designers are embedded in autonomous pods and need to keep shipping fast. Maintaining speed without compromising on coherence and quality is the job. If that tension sounds like an exciting problem to solve rather than a contradiction to complain about, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the team.&lt;/strong&gt; Hire, grow, and retain a high-performing design team, identifying people who will thrive and raise the bar at Amplitude. Develop them through direct, specific feedback. Help someone who&#39;s stuck get moving again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set direction.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the design strategy for Amplitude&#39;s product suite: Core Amplitude, Statsig, and Wave (a proactive agent that helps teams build self-improving products). Help define how agents and humans work together in the same workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion craft.&lt;/strong&gt; Strong visual design builds trust, clarity, and delight in the era of AI. Lead by example, elevating the quality of the product through exceptional design execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hold a high bar.&lt;/strong&gt; AI makes it cheap to ship UI changes, which makes it easy for quality to erode quietly. Set a clear standard for what good looks like and enforce it without becoming an approval bottleneck.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay in production.&lt;/strong&gt; You believe that “the design” is what ships. Code is the material that brings the design to life. Push on the details, the papercuts, the edge cases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speak for the customer.&lt;/strong&gt; Show up in leadership conversations as the voice of the customer, pushing for solutions that genuinely serve their needs and reduce complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve managed senior, independent IC designers and earned their respect through product and craft judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve shipped products that moved real customer and business metrics, fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve &lt;em&gt;created&lt;/em&gt; (not inherited) structure inside of a messy, high-growth organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve shipped AI-native experiences and use AI tools in your own practice today (we&#39;ll ask what you built and what you learned).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your portfolio shows both systems-level thinking and pixel-level craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: You’ve designed for both technical &lt;em&gt;and &lt;/em&gt;non-technical users, and can hold that tension without compromising the experience for either.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Experience with Analytics, Experimentation, or Developer tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this is &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not an executive role that manages up and delegates down. You&#39;re deep in the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not a pure IC role. You&#39;re accountable for a team of 15.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not design ops. Your job isn&#39;t to add rituals, templates, or governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not the approval committee. Pods keep moving; you create coherence without becoming the bottleneck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
