&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Amplitude is the leading AI analytics platform, helping over 4,700 customers—including Atlassian, Burger King, NBCUniversal, and Square—build better products and digital experiences. With powerful AI Agents embedded across our platform, teams can analyze, test, and optimize user experiences faster than ever. Ranked #1 across multiple categories in G2’s Winter 2026 Report, Amplitude is the best-in-class solution for product, data, and marketing teams. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://amplitude.com&quot;&gt;amplitude.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an organization, we deliver for our customers by living our values. We operate from a place of humility, take ownership of problems and successes, approach challenges with a growth mindset, and put our customers at the center of everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplitude’s Commitment to Diversity Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion (DEI): &lt;/strong&gt;Amplitude believes that diversity enables the creation of better products, improves the ability to solve complex problems, and drives more powerful solutions. We strive to create an environment of inclusion—one focused on psychological safety, empathy, and human connection—that will allow employees of all backgrounds to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The North America Field Marketing team is responsible for driving regional growth by creating marketing strategies that generate pipeline, accelerate opportunities, and strengthen customer relationships. As the &lt;strong&gt;Senior Field Marketing Manager, East Region&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the field marketing strategy across one of Amplitude&#39;s most important territories, partnering closely with Sales leadership to identify opportunities, influence regional priorities, and deliver programs that create measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly cross-functional role for someone who enjoys thinking strategically while remaining hands-on in execution. You&#39;ll combine data, creativity, and strong business partnership to develop innovative campaigns, events, executive experiences, and account-based programs that help our teams engage prospects and customers throughout the buyer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive in a fast-paced environment, enjoy building from the ground up, and love collaborating across Sales and Marketing to solve problems creatively, we&#39;d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Sr. Field Marketing Manager, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the “CMO” of Amplitude’s East Region - owning the marketing strategy end to end; developing regional programs that generate pipeline, accelerate opportunities, and support revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
