&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amplitude’s Commitment to Diversity Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion (DEI): &lt;/strong&gt;Amplitude believes that diversity enables the creation of better products, improves the ability to solve complex problems, and drives more powerful solutions. We strive to create an environment of inclusion—one focused on psychological safety, empathy, and human connection—that will allow employees of all backgrounds to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This individual will manage a select portfolio of high-value, complex enterprise accounts, including both existing customers and new logos. They will build meaningful executive relationships, develop and execute strategic account plans, and drive ARR growth by expanding product adoption and delivering exceptional customer value. The Strategic AE must excel at navigating multi-stakeholder environments, managing complex sales cycles, and leveraging internal and external resources to achieve measurable success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
