&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quiet Confidence &amp;amp; Executive Presence: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Leads impactful conversations across all organizational levels, from C-level executives to practitioners. Demonstrates the ability to listen actively, challenge viewpoints constructively, and influence decisions with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Takes responsibility for driving outcomes and aligning resources, ensures accountability and consistently delivers results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Earns Trust: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
